name ktv-texdata
category Package
revision 27369
shortdesc Extract subsets of documents
relocated 1
longdesc The package defines an exercice environment which numbers every
longdesc exercise, and a command \get to extract a collection whose
longdesc argument is a comma-separated set of exercise index numbers.
longdesc While the package was designed for teachers constructing tables
longdesc of exercises, it plainly has more general application.
